WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.075
Band widths show the amounts of energy: wider means more.

2
00:00:04.678 --> 00:00:09.153
A coal power station: a thousand joules of chemical energy in.

3
00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:14.830
Straight on, three hundred and fifty joules of electricity, the useful part.

4
00:00:15.531 --> 00:00:21.431
Bending away, six hundred and fifty joules of waste heat. Efficiency: thirty five percent.
